# GMT 1569242020.7874
#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgctxt "firewall"
msgid "Disabling the Web Application Firewall can open your Siberian to potential XSS, Injection & various security issues, the WAF is not a guarantee your Siberian is attack proof, but highly helps filtering the most common web attacks."
msgstr "Desactivar el tallafoc d'aplicacions web (WAF) pot exposar Siberian a possibles XSS, injeccions i diversos problemes de seguretat; el WAF no garanteix que Siberian sigui a prova d'atacs, però ajuda molt a filtrar els atacs web més habituals."

# GMT 1569242020.7875
